stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> DRAFT
  DRAFT --> CALCULATING: calculate
  CALCULATING --> CALCULATED: engine complete
  CALCULATED --> STALE: base plan changed
  STALE --> REBASING: rebase
  REBASING --> CALCULATING: recalculate
  CALCULATED --> OPTIMIZING: optimize
  OPTIMIZING --> OPTIMIZED: candidates generated
  OPTIMIZED --> APPROVAL_PENDING: submit
  APPROVAL_PENDING --> APPROVED: approval chain passed
  APPROVAL_PENDING --> REJECTED: rejected
  APPROVED --> COMMITTED: commit
  COMMITTED --> [*]
